      "role": "user",
      "content": "hey so i had that surgery on my stomach about 5 days ago and i'm feeling kinda weird. the pain is actually getting worse instead of better and i have a bit of a fever. also my stomach feels really hard and stiff when i press on it. is this just part of the healing or should i be worried?",
