      "content": "It is understandable to be worried about costs and feeling anxious, but please do not try to manage these symptoms alone at home. Fever, increasing pain, and a firm, distended stomach are signs that require professional medical evaluation. Giving yourself additional ibuprofen or using heat could mask a serious problem instead of resolving it. Contact your post-operative care line or an urgent care facility immediately for guidance.",
